  "title": "Fix syntax in tshark man page examples",
  "description": "Applies the suggested corrections to the tshark man page from #19125.\n\nNote that, on an 80 column display, the example for `-e` breaks across two lines:\n\n           Example: tshark -T fields -e frame.number -e ip.addr -e udp -e\n           _ws.col.info\n\nRemoving `-e frame.number` or `-e ip.addr` fixes that, at the expense of an example that's slightly less demonstrative of real-world use.\n\nCloses #19125",
